breaking_changes.Adaptation_method:
Before: No explicit call needed — initialization was automatic.
After: Explicitly call `loadTests()` and `setupEmberOnerrorValidation()` in test setup.

Example:
```javascript
import { loadTests, setupEmberOnerrorValidation } from '@ember/test-helpers';

// Ensure these are called
loadTests();
setupEmberOnerrorValidation();
```
